<title>USA: Koppers Industries Inc Q4 shr increases.</title>
<headline>Koppers Industries Inc Q4 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>(000S EXCEPT SHARES FIGURES)</p>
<p>			    THREE MONTHS ENDED     YEAR ENDED</p>
<p>				 DECEMBER 31,	 DECEMBER 31,</p>
<p>			   1996	  1995	 1996	  1995</p>
<p> NET SALES	  $145,034    $127,066   $588,544    $525,730</p>
<p> NET INCOME	    8,571	 4,185     14,098	24,440</p>
<p> EARNINGS PER SHARE   0.91	  0.40	 1.47	  2.36</p>
<p>AVERAGE SHARES</p>
<p>  OUTSTANDING    9,372,311  10,492,717  9,619,713  10,376,658</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 results include $28.1 million in one-time charges related to litigation settlements and restructuring charges.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
